findings.fix:
Add fallback logic: if sanitized filename is empty or only underscores, use default 'export'. Updated function:

let sanitized = input.replace(/[^\w\s\-.]/g, '_');
sanitized = sanitized.replace(/[\s_]+/g, '_').trim().replace(/^_|_$/g, '');
if (!sanitized) sanitized = 'export';
return sanitized.substring(0, 200);
